NAME
    gcloud beta backup-dr data-sources - view Backup and DR data sources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta backup-dr data-sources COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA) View Backup and DR data sources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        (BETA) Show details of the data source.

     list
        (BETA) List Data Sources.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice. These
    variants are also available:

        $ gcloud backup-dr data-sources

        $ gcloud alpha backup-dr data-sources

